  "definition": "Early Childhood Education Teacher",
  "effectiveDate": "2022-11-11",
  "historyNote": "#6349, eff 10-5-96; rpld by #7923, eff 7-24-03 New. #9305, eff 10-25-08; amd by #10130, eff 5-18-12; ss by #13484, eff 11-11-22",
